<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Large image files delay the Largest Contentful Paint, a key metric Google tracks. When hero or product images load slowly, the whole page feels sluggish.&nbsp;Visitors on slower connections suffer most, leading to poor scores.</p>



<h3 class="wp-block-heading">Higher Bounce Rates and Lost Sales in WooCommerce</h3>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Shoppers expect quick views of products. If galleries lag from heavy jpeg images or png files, many leave before buying.&nbsp;This directly hits revenue in competitive US markets.</p>



