<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Image compression reduces file size by removing redundant data or rewriting pixel information efficiently. It uses algorithms to either keep every detail exact or discard less noticeable parts. In my years building WordPress sites, I&#8217;ve seen how smart image optimization makes pages load much faster without visible changes.</p>
