<p class="wp-block-paragraph">When you need to know is it down right now, fast tools provide instant answers. Just enter the URL and they display the current status of your website along with any recent server activity.&nbsp;These quick checks often include basic website monitoring features, showing if the page returns a normal response code or errors. Many users rely on them daily to access sites without guessing.&nbsp;For anyone managing a WordPress page, pairing these with regular habits reduces surprises from unexpected website crashes.</p>



