<p class="wp-block-paragraph">In 2025, several large scale disruptions highlighted how interconnected everything has become. Cloud provider problems spiked, with public cloud network outages jumping sharply in the US. Issues often started from configuration changes or logic errors in proxy systems, spreading quickly.</p>



