<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Network disruptions from providers like Cloudflare and others showed cascading effects, where one failure impacted many dependent services. These patterns remind WordPress users on cloud hosting providers or best cloud hosting for small businesses that even strong setups face risks from shared infrastructure.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Events like these often stem from attempts to fix vulnerabilities or routine updates gone wrong, leading to temporary but widespread problems.</p>



