<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Poor website uptime can negatively impact search rankings, as engines favor consistent website availability. Slow response time or frequent outages erode trust, making people question reliability.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">For e commerce or course sites, even short periods inaccessible translate to real revenue loss during peak hours. Repeated issues damage reputation, pushing users to alternatives.&nbsp;Overall, ignoring these problems risks long term harm to growth and customer loyalty.</p>



