<h3 class="wp-block-heading">Slow Website Speed from Plugin Overload</h3>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Adding multiple plugins to extend LearnDash creates heavy loads. Each extra lms plugin adds scripts and database queries that slow page loads. Students notice delays when accessing course content or taking quizzes and that hurts the learning experience. Slow sites also affect search rankings for online courses using the platform.</p>



<h3 class="wp-block-heading">Limited Customization Without Coding</h3>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">The core LearnDash tools work well, but changing layouts or adding unique flows usually needs custom code or more add ons. For example, altering the learner dashboard or creating special course completion rules feels restricted. Many rely on template overrides that break during product updates.</p>



