<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Connecting LearnDash to tools like MemberPress, BuddyPress, or external APIs can cause conflicts. Payments through WooCommerce work, but advanced memberships or automations often need workarounds. These gaps make managing successful online courses harder.</p>



<h3 class="wp-block-heading">Tracking Learner Progress and Reporting Gaps</h3>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Basic reports show progress, but detailed views on individual student progress or time spent require add ons like LearnDash ProPanel. Even then, large sites face slow loading or missing filters for specific learning outcomes.</p>



